<title>ALBANIA: Albania July CPI falls 1.2 pct m/m, up 35 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Albania July CPI falls 1.2 pct m/m, up 35 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following main economic indicator on Friday:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN INFLATION	   JULY	JUNE	  JULY 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI change (pct)   - 1.2	+ 5.41     + 1.3</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change		+35.02     +40.13     +14.8</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	 182.3	184.54     133.4</p>
<p>--Tirana Newsroom, +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
